flowchart TB
    A([START]) --> B[Open chatbot]
    B --> C[Load user context]
    C --> D[Welcome message]
    D --> E[User question]
    E --> F[NLP: intent + entities]
    F --> G{Intent?}
    G -->|limit| H[Query limits]
    G -->|payment| I[Query installments]
    G -->|bank| J[Query bank info]
    G -->|other| K[FAQ / support]
    H --> L[Format reply]
    I --> L
    J --> L
    K --> L
    L --> M[Log interaction]
    M --> N[Show reply]
    N --> P{More?}
    P -->|Yes| E
    P -->|No| END1([END])
